<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113039" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάλκ-ειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Ep.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάλκεος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of copper</i> or <i>bronze,
				brazen,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγχεϊ χαλκείῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.380
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰχμὴ χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.461
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κληΐς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					21.7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐγὴ χ.</span> gleam <i>of
				brass,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.341
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάλκειον γένος,</span> of the
			Age <i>of brass,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				144
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰκὼ χαλκείην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Maiist.
					15
				</span></i>
			: once in Trag., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάλκειον κάρα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				537
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάλκεον</span>); in
			late Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάλκειος σφαῖρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					7.376
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάλκειος, ἡ,</span>
			<i>yellow fish thistle, Carlina corymbosa,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				6.4.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				21.94
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλκήϊος.</span>
			
		</div>
